{"id":"b413098ea36613bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-measure9-brownian-law.md","title":"ZFC Measure9 Brownian Law","display":"df-zfc-measure9-brownian-law — ZFC Measure9 Brownian Law","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure9-brownian-law","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure9-brownian-law"],"display":"df-zfc-measure9-brownian-law — ZFC Measure9 Brownian Law","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-brownian]]","[[58-df-measure]]","[[58-df-probability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure9-brownian-law"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-brownian-law</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure9-brownian-law — ZFC Measure9 Brownian Law"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8fc074624288fbbb\" href=\"?note=8fc074624288fbbb\" title=\"58-df-brownian\">58-df-brownian</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"58-df-probability\">58-df-probability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (probability measure), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_C\">\\(\\Omega_C\\)</span> (path-space carrier), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_C\">\\(\\Sigma_C\\)</span> (its Borel sigma algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=\\langle W_t:t\\geq0\\rangle\">\\(W=\\langle W_t:t\\geq0\\rangle\\)</span> (coordinate process on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_C\">\\(\\Omega_C\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8fc074624288fbbb\" href=\"?note=8fc074624288fbbb\" title=\"58-df-brownian\">58-df-brownian</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"58-df-probability\">58-df-probability</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Brownian}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Brownian}_S\\)</span> (Brownian-motion predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8fc074624288fbbb\" href=\"?note=8fc074624288fbbb\" title=\"58-df-brownian\">58-df-brownian</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9BrownianLaw}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9BrownianLaw}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}law} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9BrownianLaw}_S(\\mu,W,\\Omega_C,\\Sigma_C)\\leftrightarrow \\Omega_C=C(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R)\\land\\Sigma_C=\\mathcal B(\\Omega_C)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,\\Omega_C,\\Sigma_C)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega_C\\;(W(t)(x)=x(t))\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(W,\\Omega_C,\\Sigma_C,\\mu)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}law} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9BrownianLaw}_S(\\mu,W,\\Omega_C,\\Sigma_C)\\leftrightarrow \\Omega_C=C(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R)\\land\\Sigma_C=\\mathcal B(\\Omega_C)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,\\Omega_C,\\Sigma_C)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega_C\\;(W(t)(x)=x(t))\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(W,\\Omega_C,\\Sigma_C,\\mu)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical path carrier and its Borel sigma algebra are actual predicate arguments, so the Brownian-law relation no longer depends on hidden ambient objects.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-brownian","status":"resolved","id":"8fc074624288fbbb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-brownian]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-brownian","status":"resolved","id":"8fc074624288fbbb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W=\\langle W_t:t\\geq0\\rangle$ (coordinate process on $\\Omega_C$, see [[58-df-brownian]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}$ (probability-measure predicate, see [[58-df-probability]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-brownian","status":"resolved","id":"8fc074624288fbbb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Brownian}_S$ (Brownian-motion predicate, see [[58-df-brownian]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_C","display":false},{"tex":"W=\\langle W_t:t\\geq0\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Brownian}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9BrownianLaw}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}law} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9BrownianLaw}_S(\\mu,W,\\Omega_C,\\Sigma_C)\\leftrightarrow \\Omega_C=C(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R)\\land\\Sigma_C=\\mathcal B(\\Omega_C)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(\\mu,\\Omega_C,\\Sigma_C)\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega_C\\;(W(t)(x)=x(t))\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(W,\\Omega_C,\\Sigma_C,\\mu)","display":true}],"bytes":1431,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2664","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-measure9-brownian-law.md|58-df-zfc-measure9-brownian-law]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","8fc074624288fbbb","ca832ed6bc22f728","5e0db065132180df"]}